	(text "EN: RC 10 kΩ / 1 µF (τ = 10 ms): the ESP32 starts\nonce 3V3 is already stable.\nGPIO0 has internal pull-up: BOOT + RESET = download.\nDevelopment: native USB (GPIO19/20) on test pads TP401–TP403;\nthe Pi can also reset/boot the ESP32 (sheet 7) and flash it over UART0\n(ROM bootloader, esptool on /dev/serial0)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 190.5 0)
