		(uuid "fef404b5-c914-57fe-8023-3b7ae44e75fd")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n• Strapping: GPIO45 (VDD_SPI) only drives MOT_STBY with pull-down → 3.3 V flash. GPIO46: test point only (internal pull-down).\n• GPIO3 → IRQ_N (JTAG on GPIO3 only if the eFuse is burned). GPIO35–37: octal PSRAM, do not use.\n• GPIO1 (RTC GPIO, held in deep sleep) → PI_PWR_OFF (high = Pi rail off). UART0 (GPIO43/44) = link to the Pi (also ROM download);\n  GPIO4/5 = UART1 on the debug header J401. GPIO41 → servo PWM. Pin map chosen for the board layout (rear signals on the right column).\n• GPIO19/20: native USB on test pads only (short stubs). 33 Ω series on the display SPI: limits edge rates into the head cable.\n• Antenna at the left board edge: keep-out (no copper, all layers) under and around the antenna."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 223.52 0)
